# Set the CARLA weather preset. The AirSim drone camera sees it: mean pixel delta 45.8
# measured between ClearNoon and HardRainSunset, which is the air-ground coupling that makes
# CARLA-Air worth using over a bare AirSim map.
#
# An unknown preset is a FAILURE with the valid list in `message`, not a silent fallback to
# clear skies - a scenario named "rain_descent" running in sunshine would score fine and mean
# nothing.
string preset                   # e.g. ClearNoon, HardRainSunset
---
bool success
string applied                  # the preset now in effect
string message                  # on failure, the valid presets
